# NOTICE

## Rental Data

Listing data retrieved by this tool is provided by the Rentcast API
(https://rentcast.io). Use of the Rentcast API is subject to Rentcast's
Terms of Service (https://rentcast.io/terms).

### Personal use

This tool is designed for **personal, non-commercial rental searching only**.
It is not intended for data aggregation, redistribution, or any commercial
purpose. The Rentcast free tier is explicitly for personal use — please review
Rentcast's current Terms of Service before deploying.

### Data stored

`data/seen-listings.json` stores only listing IDs and first-seen dates — not
full listing data (addresses, prices, or other PII). The raw API response is
uploaded as a GitHub Actions artifact with a 7-day retention period and is
never committed to the repository. Both choices are intentional to remain
within the spirit of Rentcast's personal-use terms.

### Attribution

If you publish results or derivative works, consider adding "data from
Rentcast" to your attribution. Check Rentcast's current Terms of Service for
the latest requirements.
